# Crafted Dancer Artifact (hidden quest DncArtifact), not a Dancer: a level 99 Warrior in Upper Jeuno, The Road to
# Divadom completed, Prog 2, Status 7 (GMs). Olgald: the check (main job Dancer) fails: his default 10122. Matthias:
# section 2 fails: his default 499.
lists BastokMarkets/Matthias/onTrade UpperJeuno/Olgald/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Matthias/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-53,0,101.9 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToDivadom completed
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 2
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Status 7
item SquareOfImperialSilkCloth
item SquareOfWolfFelt
item SquareOfSilverBrocade
login
trigger Olgald                          # not a Dancer: 10122
finish
warp -114.1,-4.3,-105.8 BastokMarkets
trigger Matthias                        # not a Dancer: 499
finish
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 4        # a GM
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Option 1
trade Matthias SquareOfImperialSilkCloth x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1 SquareOfSilverBrocade x1   # not a Dancer: nothing
